Hello folks.

A MTD flash device database is now available at:
http://www.embeddedlinuxworks.com/db.html

If you have managed to get a particular brand of flash/Doc/RAM/ROM/FRAM 
etc. etc. working under the MTD drivers please consider taking a few 
moments to enter your data in the above database.

This will be a great help to folks that want to know if a particular type 
of flash chip is supported under MTD, which driver file to use for it, how 
many folks have had success with it, if any exclusions apply etc.

Thanks

Vipin
